                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "19819994",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198002870741",
                            "num_reviews": 140,
                            "playtime_forever": 243,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 243,
                            "last_played": 1449326652
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ever wanted to take part in the Arthur saga? Now is your time to change one of britains most famous stories.\n\nWhile it differs in quite some things  from the original (naturally), it catches the dramatic events of Arthurs way from bastard son to Ruler of the Kingdom in it´s war against the evil Saxon invaders.\nOffering a special treat, Pendragon Rising includes the option to change the whole main cast from male to female, which also presents a different take on the story itself.\n\nWill you strive to make peace via diplomacy wherever possible or be a revengeful ruler without mercy? An opportunistic coward or a true hero, who inspires your folk with brave speeches?\nThe writing is also enjoyable enough to fit the theme, while friends of the classic adventure topic, where you rally your allies together with your close group of friends should feel right at home.\n\nConclusio: This has to be one of my favourite CYoA books up to now, as the atmosphere is really enjoyable, the characters likeable/hateable and it has enough content, to play it more than once, and even get a fully different setting.\n\nRating: 8/10",
